# SCPN ICF Impact Core — citation metadata
cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you reference this repository, cite it as below. No release, version,
  or DOI exists yet; cite the repository state you inspected.
type: software
title: SCPN ICF Impact Core
abstract: >-
  Governed device-family repository for the projectile/impact inertial
  confinement fusion configuration within the SCPN Reactor Systems
  Research Group. Evidence maturity computational_prototype: a validated
  device configuration model, diagnostic and clock semantics aligned with
  the SCPN Phase Orchestrator observability catalogue, level-0 device
  physics (what a flying plate carries onto its target, the fuel of the
  two published target geometries, and where that fuel ends up when
  compressed), and tessellated and B-rep models of both published
  schemes. All parameter sets are synthetic or anchored on a freely
  published workshop proceedings; no real machine is described, and the
  claim inventory is empty.
